    "text": "KUTV\nwebsite\nLogan\nTalkin' Sports: Bryson Barnes on football, Logan, and one final season\nBy Adam Mikulich, KUTV,\n5 hours agoSALT LAKE CITY (KUTV) — The Mountain West Conference is set for one more traditional school year before the existing members and a few others converge to create the new Pac-12. Football media days were held in Las Vegas July 16th and 17th, and first-year head coach Bronco Mendenhall led the Aggies into the start-studded event along with two player representatives: Senior Quarterback Bryson Barnes and Senior Defensive Lineman Gabriel Iniguez Jr.",
